OL,3,GEast Midlands
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FWidely cloudy across the region
OL,6,Fwith the odd spot of rain in the
OL,7,Fsouth. Clearer and brighter conditions
OL,8,Fmove southwards to allow some sunny
OL,9,Fspells. Near-normal temperatures,
OL,10,Fcolder overnight.
OL,11,
OL,12,CTonight:FA dry night with clear spells
OL,13,Fdeveloping, but perhaps the odd shower
OL,14,Fat first towards the Lincolnshire
OL,15,Fcoast. Becoming chilly by dawn.
OL,16,
OL,17,CThursday:FA dry, bright and largely
OL,18,Fsunny day for most. Showery near the
OL,19,Fcoast however, and becoming breezy
OL,20,Fhere too. Cold and frosty overnight.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
