OL,3,GEast Midlands
OL,4,
OL,5,COutlook for Friday to Sunday:FA cold
OL,6,Fand frosty start on Friday, but a dry
OL,7,Fday with sunshine. Becoming cold again
OL,8,Fovernight under clear skies. Turning
OL,9,Fcloudier and less cold from Saturday,
OL,10,Fbut remaining dry.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
